# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */

.text {
	user-select: text;
	user-select: auto;
	user-select: none auto;
	-webkit-user-select: all;
	-moz-user-select: inherit;
	color: none;
	--user-select: none;
	user-select: var(--selection, none);
}

@supports (user-select: none) {
	.button {
		user-select: text;
	}
}
```
